              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watieko kelo mic pa Rwoth ma kisi dhano kwoŋ wan onwaŋo, gigipiny ma zahabu, pogo kodi atege, petin, milomin kodi tikin, paka mic ma cul mawan ruwaŋ Rwoth.” ",
