              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa kodi Eliazar jacway ri Were i wi migam jojolo zahabu wok bongi jomituka ma ganin kodi jomituka ma miyin, aka jokelo i Wema ma Romo paka rapoy ri Joisiraili ruwaŋ Rwoth.",
